ght)\n    end\nend","features":"You can change the color by messing with the Color3.fromRGB (rn it is red)\n\n\nESP is a type of game cheat that displays hidden information on your screen that you normally wouldn’t be able to see. For example, it can show enemy locations, names, health, distance, or items through walls. It gives the player extra information and an unfair advantage","tags":["ESP","esp","Esp","Simple esp","simple esp"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69a32a8a11afc6c1a51563bf","username":"dimkata","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"69a32a8a11afc6c1a51563bf","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:27:01.140Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a76e50de023172a3c6e9b65","editBy":{"_id":"69a32a8a11afc6c1a51563bf","username":"dimkata","status":"offline","id":"69a32a8a11afc6c1a51563bf"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-08-08T08:13:01.639Z"}],"comments":[]}